- # `↯/s.73.10` — `Timezone.Error`
+ # `↯/s.73.10` — `Timezone.Error`

- Raised when a value does not name a known timezone.
+ Se lanza cuando un valor no nombra una zona horaria conocida.

- ## Cause
+ ## Causa

- Aviation looks timezones up by IANA name (e.g. `Europe/Paris`). When
- the name is not present in the loaded TZDB, this error is thrown.
+ Aviation busca las zonas horarias por su nombre IANA (p. ej., `Europe/Paris`). Cuando el nombre no
+ está en la TZDB cargada, se lanza este error.

- ## Example message
+ ## Mensaje de ejemplo

=
- ```
+ ```

- [↯/s.73.10] the name Mars/Olympus does not refer to a known timezone
+ [↯/s.73.10] the name Mars/Olympus does not refer to a known timezone

= [↯/s.73.10] the name Mars/Olympus does not refer to a known timezone
- ```
+ ```

- ## Resolution
+ ## Solución

- Use a name from the TZDB; for legacy abbreviations (`PST`, `EST`)
- prefer the corresponding IANA zone (`America/Los_Angeles`,
- `America/New_York`).
+ Usa un nombre de la TZDB; en lugar de las abreviaturas heredadas (`PST`, `EST`), es preferible la
+ zona IANA correspondiente (`America/Los_Angeles`, `America/New_York`).

- ## See also
+ ## Véase también

- - Source: `lib/aviation/src/core/aviation.Timezone.scala`
